{
 "name": "fern_saddle",
 "description": "A riding saddle made of fern fronds, side view facing right: raised cantle at the back (left), a dipped seat, raised pommel with a stubby horn at the front (right). Seat built from three fronds laid side by side (midribs with leaflets, a leaflet fringe along the top edge), a dark frond skirt with leaflets hanging over the side, dark-green shadow under the seat lip, a frond fender hanging to a rounded D-shaped stirrup of twisted stem (second stirrup behind, darker), two twisted-stem girth straps. Anchor centre, x -160..160, y -90..90.",
